1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,770
One man risked his own life and saved thousands.

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:08,670
3 December, after 1 am. Bhopal Junction.

3
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:11,570
The poisonous gas had reached the station.

4
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:15,570
A crowded express train stood at the platform.

5
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:18,850
Deputy station superintendent Ghulam Dastagir.

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:24,410
He did not wait for orders. He sent the train off ahead of time.

7
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:29,170
Then he stayed at his post and kept warning the other stations,

8
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,970
so that no other train would stop in Bhopal.

9
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:36,310
The gas from that night left him ill for the rest of his life.

10
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:39,950
Remember heroes like him. Subscribe to the channel.

